read flavor text you'd probably never notice the difference.  

But, to drag my personal issues out into the open a little bit, 
I don't ever want to be at a writer's or software developer's 
conference, give my little talk about the evils of copyright abuse
and how excessive copyrights are stifling creative new work, and 
then have to field accusations about conflict of interest arising 
from infringements in a program I maintain.  So whatever I make, my 
standard will not be "what I could probably get away with." My standard
will have to be "giving no grounds for accusation even to people who 
are explicitly looking for ways to discredit me on copyright issues."  

